{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>This Torah.</b> The section of the king, which he now commanded to be read at the assembly." "<b>And he gave it to the priests, the sons of Levi.</b> For from their hand the king who reads it will receive it, as we learned: the deputy gives it to the High Priest, and the High Priest to the king (Sotah 41a)." "<b>Who bear the ark.</b> Who carried it at the time a miracle was renewed through it." "<b>And to all the elders of Israel.</b> For from their hand the priests will receive the Torah at the assembly, as we learned (Sotah 41a): the synagogue attendant gives it to the head of the synagogue, and the head of the synagogue to the deputy."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:45.268263101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}